# Logs
*.log

# EXCLUSIONS / WHITELIST (Pastikan Python Scripts & Chromedriver tetap terlacak)
!*.py
!requirements.txt
!chromedriver.exe
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.chromedriver
!readme.md
!README.md
!.gitignore
